|errata_history=The Holotable repository first records this image on 2018-07-08. This is an initial repository import; the image may be older. The E image has Dark Side text above the artwork and the blank Light Side text box below. The game text is unchanged across these three images. Text boxes from this image: [[File:Dantooine-Dark-PC-E1-top-text.png|frameless|upright=1.1]] [[File:Dantooine-Dark-PC-E1-bottom-text.png|frameless|upright=1.1]]. Earlier actual 2017 frame [[Dantooine (Dark) (PC Errata)]]. Before: [[File:Premiere-D-dantooinedark-June-2017-partial.png|frameless|300px]]. After: [[File:Premiere-D-Dantooine-PC-E1-2018-07-08.gif|frameless|300px]]. Both print <code>E</code>. Source dates are first located records, not proven first publication days.
